      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "The preserved steam locomotive represents an epochal juncture in the history of transportation.",
          "grammar": "represent / in the history of",
          "ja": "保存された蒸気機関車は、交通史における一時代を画する転換点を象徴しています。",
          "type": "gist",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "The emergence of steam-powered railways revolutionized the movement of both passengers and freight.",
          "grammar": "動名詞的名詞句 / both A and B",
          "ja": "蒸気鉄道の登場は、旅客と貨物の双方の移動を革命的に変えました。",
          "type": "gist",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "By dramatically reducing travel time, railways enhanced mobility across regions that had previously been difficult to connect.",
          "grammar": "By＋動名詞 / 関係代名詞that / 過去完了形",
          "ja": "移動時間を大幅に短縮することで、鉄道は以前は結び付けることが困難だった地域間の移動性を高めました。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "The locomotive therefore symbolizes a pivotal transition from traditional transportation to mechanized mass transit.",
          "grammar": "symbolize / transition from A to B",
          "ja": "したがって、この機関車は従来の交通から機械化された大量輸送への極めて重要な転換を象徴しています。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "Railway expansion accelerated industrialization by allowing raw materials and manufactured goods to circulate more efficiently.",
          "grammar": "by＋動名詞 / allow O to",
          "ja": "鉄道網の拡大は、原材料や製品をより効率的に流通させることで工業化を加速させました。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "At this epochal juncture, technological innovation began reshaping patterns of commerce, settlement, employment, and everyday life.",
          "grammar": "begin＋動名詞 / 並列",
          "ja": "この画期的な転換点において、技術革新は商業、居住、雇用、日常生活のあり方を変え始めました。",
          "type": "gist",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "The museum preserves the locomotive not merely as an obsolete machine but as evidence of a transformative period in social history.",
          "grammar": "not merely A but B",
          "ja": "博物館はこの機関車を単なる時代遅れの機械としてではなく、社会史の大変革期を示す証拠として保存しています。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "The visitors are effectively confronting an artifact that once helped usher in an entirely new economic and technological era.",
          "grammar": "関係代名詞that / help＋動詞",
          "ja": "来館者たちは、かつて全く新しい経済・技術時代の到来に貢献した歴史的遺物と向き合っていると言えます。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "Overall, the scene provides useful practice in describing an epochal juncture, industrialization, mechanization, transportation infrastructure, technological innovation, mobility, historical transition, and social transformation.",
